{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08312","headline":"赠汉阳辅录事二首 二 · 李白","name":"赠汉阳辅录事二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹦鹉洲横汉阳渡，水引寒烟没江树。\n南浦登楼不见君，君今罢官在何处？\n汉口双鱼白锦鳞，令传尺素报情人。\n其中字数无多少，祗是相思秋复春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}